## Who should come?

An active spa stay is suitable for virtually everyone — from convalescents to athletes seeking active recovery. We especially recommend it for:

- **Those over 50** — prevention of sarcopenia (muscle loss)
- **Sedentary professions** — restoring healthy movement patterns
- **After injuries and surgeries** — supervised rehabilitation in nature
- **Athletes** — recovery and training at altitude

More about [activities in Marienbad](/en/things-to-do) and [planning your stay](/en/practical-information).
